  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MWI-UNHCR-Protection-Dzaleka Camp (MWI333)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Focus on providing prevention and response interventions to refugee protection issues through the four thematic areas of Gender Based Violence (GBV), Distribution of Food and Non-Food Items, Human Rights (HR) and Child Protection (CP) as well as strategise on integrating the two additional sectors to ensure that the communities we serve are protected from all forms of abuse as well as building their resilience as they live in the host country.</narrative>
  </description>
